{"3231740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Care", "steam_appid": 3231740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric first person horror game you step into the shoes of a caregiver, assigned yet another contract.   <br>This time to watch over Mr. Graves, an elderly man living in his isolated mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/1a8c5938dd78f68e9b9e6d667c56ef7f.poster.avif?t=1752221682\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/1a8c5938dd78f68e9b9e6d667c56ef7f.webm?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/1a8c5938dd78f68e9b9e6d667c56ef7f.mp4?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple job, starts to turn into something far from the ordinary. Be careful with your actions as they will shape the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/2b917e783c9f58092f3f62b9954a0598.poster.avif?t=1752221682\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/2b917e783c9f58092f3f62b9954a0598.webm?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/2b917e783c9f58092f3f62b9954a0598.mp4?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the eerie incidents that happened on the estate, solve puzzles and be observant to find out the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/3893378cb2fe07a2638f50ff8e2f67d2.poster.avif?t=1752221682\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/3893378cb2fe07a2638f50ff8e2f67d2.webm?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/3893378cb2fe07a2638f50ff8e2f67d2.mp4?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated Retro look </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ hours of content with multiple endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dynamic dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive puzzles</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric first person horror game you step into the shoes of a caregiver, assigned yet another contract.   <br>This time to watch over Mr. Graves, an elderly man living in his isolated mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/1a8c5938dd78f68e9b9e6d667c56ef7f.poster.avif?t=1752221682\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/1a8c5938dd78f68e9b9e6d667c56ef7f.webm?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/1a8c5938dd78f68e9b9e6d667c56ef7f.mp4?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple job, starts to turn into something far from the ordinary. Be careful with your actions as they will shape the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/2b917e783c9f58092f3f62b9954a0598.poster.avif?t=1752221682\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/2b917e783c9f58092f3f62b9954a0598.webm?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/2b917e783c9f58092f3f62b9954a0598.mp4?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the eerie incidents that happened on the estate, solve puzzles and be observant to find out the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/3893378cb2fe07a2638f50ff8e2f67d2.poster.avif?t=1752221682\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/3893378cb2fe07a2638f50ff8e2f67d2.webm?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/extras/3893378cb2fe07a2638f50ff8e2f67d2.mp4?t=1752221682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated Retro look </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ hours of content with multiple endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dynamic dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive puzzles</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Care is an atmospheric first person horror game with puzzle elements, where your choices have consequences. Be observant with your surroundings and unravel the horrific secrets that hide within these walls.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/header.jpg?t=1752221682", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/af19a26bfaa2de2efdb4168b5613a14e7508c8ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752221682", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231740/af19a26bfaa2de2efdb4168b5613a14e7508c8ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752221682", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> QuadCore AMD Ryzen 3 3300X / Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD (Solid State Drive)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["The Pocket Di